            <h2 id="bkup">100% Privacy: Everything is stored locally</h2>

            <p>
                All macros and settings are stored locally on your machine in what is called technically <a href="/howto/view-local-storage">HTML5 local storage</a>.
                <em>Nothing</em> is stored in the cloud.
                This also means that once you uninstall the <em>Ui.Vision RPA</em> extension, your test cases (macros) are gone.
                Please use the <a href="/rpa/docs#bkup">export and export all</a> features to create backups of your
                important macros and  test suites. By default, <em>Ui.Vision RPA</em> prompts you every seven days to do a backup.
            </p>
            <p>
                Related forum posts: <a href="https://forum.ocr.space/t/how-to-restore-a-backup-kantu-chr-ff/289">How to restore a backup</a>,
                <a href="https://forum.ocr.space/t/automatic-backup-in-kantu/166">Automatic backup in Kantu</a>
            </p>

